WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.305 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.105 --> 01:43.985
XIANZHUANG

5
01:44.065 --> 01:45.785
We weren't expecting a visit from Your Grace at this hour.

6
01:45.865 --> 01:47.185
Maternal Grandmother meant to greet you herself.

7
01:47.905 --> 01:49.145
But something came up at the estate.

8
01:49.985 --> 01:51.385
Please forgive the discourtesy.

9
01:51.465 --> 01:53.465
I meant to arrive before the Xu hour.

10
01:53.545 --> 01:55.705
But the heavy rain slowed us down. Our carriage got stuck in the mud.

11
01:55.785 --> 01:58.585
Enough of that. Take me to your maternal grandmother.

12
01:59.385 --> 02:02.225
-This way, please. -Mother, watch your step.

13
02:02.305 --> 02:04.985
XIANZHUANG

14
02:07.585 --> 02:09.825
You want me to spare those two vile women?

15
02:11.225 --> 02:14.185
They kept Rao and me apart for decades.

16
02:14.265 --> 02:17.025
They tried multiple times to turn us against each other.

17
02:17.105 --> 02:19.865
I would gladly see them put to death by a thousand cuts.

18
02:21.465 --> 02:22.305
No.

19
02:22.945 --> 02:25.305
Even if the Duchess yourself pleads for them,

20
02:26.225 --> 02:27.465
I will never forgive them.

21
02:28.185 --> 02:31.145
Your Ladyship, it's precisely for Rao's sake

22
02:31.225 --> 02:33.705
that we cannot openly have them sentenced to death.

23
02:33.785 --> 02:37.185
Noble Lady Wu'an just received her title. She's already drawn plenty of envy.

24
02:38.185 --> 02:41.705
If we hand Lady Heng'e and Lady Guo over to the authorities,

25
02:41.785 --> 02:43.625
it may feel satisfying for the moment.

26
02:43.705 --> 02:46.705
But it will also expose Rao to gossip.

27
02:48.345 --> 02:50.745
Your Ladyship, I know it pains you to see your daughter suffer.

28
02:51.265 --> 02:54.225
But if outsiders start questioning, mocking her background,

29
02:54.305 --> 02:55.785
saying her father was a gambler

30
02:56.385 --> 02:57.545
and she even killed someone…

31
02:57.625 --> 03:00.265
Then we may blame the world for it.

32
03:00.345 --> 03:02.505
My daughter did nothing wrong.

33
03:04.625 --> 03:08.785
Of course we know Rao is innocent.

34
03:08.865 --> 03:11.905
But outsiders may not be so forgiving.

35
03:13.425 --> 03:15.585
You must think of her future.

36
03:16.225 --> 03:19.305
It's best to bury this matter for good.

37
03:20.265 --> 03:23.625
I just saw Wei Heng'e.

38
03:23.705 --> 03:26.745
She's lost her mind completely.

39
03:27.705 --> 03:31.425
We could simply have her strangled.

40
03:31.945 --> 03:35.865
But after all, she's Old Madam Wei's own daughter

41
03:36.745 --> 03:38.625
and Rao's own aunt.

42
03:38.705 --> 03:40.985
If we kill her now,

43
03:41.065 --> 03:44.745
Rao's ties to the Wei family will be severed for good.

44
03:46.025 --> 03:47.825
Xianzhuang is too close to the capital.

45
03:47.905 --> 03:49.025
Word could easily get out.

46
03:49.625 --> 03:51.185
Let me take her.

47
03:51.265 --> 03:54.585
She'll do hard labor on the Lu family's northern estate

48
03:54.665 --> 03:56.145
and spend her life in exile.

49
03:56.225 --> 03:58.225
If we show her this mercy,

50
03:58.305 --> 04:01.225
the Wei family will be deeply grateful

51
04:01.305 --> 04:04.505
and repay Rao a thousandfold.

52
04:05.985 --> 04:07.305
As for Lady Guo…

53
04:07.385 --> 04:11.105
Since Duchess of Ying has pleaded for her, I'll spare her life.

54
04:11.185 --> 04:14.785
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

55
04:14.865 --> 04:16.585
But Lady Guo…

56
04:19.425 --> 04:20.985
I'll deal with her myself.

57
04:21.944 --> 04:24.145
What do you intend to do with her, Your Ladyship?

58
04:26.705 --> 04:30.505
She'll serve at Zunshan Shrine for life,

59
04:31.265 --> 04:34.745
devoting each day to prayer and penance

60
04:35.345 --> 04:37.745
to atone for her sins.

61
05:05.905 --> 05:08.465
Noble Lady Wu'an has a high fever. Get the physician, now.

62
05:09.145 --> 05:10.665
-Yes. -Hurry!

63
05:16.065 --> 05:17.185
It's cold and pouring outside.

64
05:17.265 --> 05:18.945
Governess feared you might catch a chill.

65
05:19.025 --> 05:20.305
So she had ginger tea prepared.

66
05:27.265 --> 05:30.465
My Lord, you may not know how to do it. Let me.

67
05:30.545 --> 05:31.465
Leave us.

68
05:36.985 --> 05:38.185
Are you killing me?

69
05:43.945 --> 05:47.865
I don't know how much you've suffered, but I can imagine.

70
05:47.945 --> 05:50.945
Don't act like you know everything. How much do you really know?

71
05:55.465 --> 05:57.345
The mother you longed to see…

72
06:00.225 --> 06:01.145
She let you down.

73
06:03.665 --> 06:05.585
No matter how many people try to persuade you,

74
06:06.905 --> 06:08.345
you have every right not to forgive her.

75
06:10.465 --> 06:13.545
After all, they never had to suffer like that.

76
06:14.065 --> 06:15.945
And they have no right to tell you how to feel.

77
06:24.585 --> 06:25.985
But I want to ask you one thing.

78
06:28.265 --> 06:29.705
Will you give up your title as Noble Lady Wu'an?

79
06:29.785 --> 06:30.785
Never.

80
06:31.385 --> 06:34.065
I earned this title myself. I won't give it up for anyone.

81
06:37.865 --> 06:39.585
The title carries immense responsibility.

82
06:40.345 --> 06:43.185
Countless people under your rule depend on your protection.

83
06:43.865 --> 06:47.545
You can be angry and disappointed. You can grieve.

84
06:50.905 --> 06:52.385
But you only get tonight.

85
06:54.825 --> 06:55.705
What's in your mind?

86
07:02.025 --> 07:04.825
My birth mother is the Emperor's beloved Lady Li.

87
07:06.905 --> 07:08.905
Now I can really throw my weight around.

88
07:11.905 --> 07:13.145
Well, impressive.

89
07:20.785 --> 07:22.825
-What are you doing? -Try to put you to sleep.

90
07:24.185 --> 07:25.185
When my cousin was sick,

91
07:26.065 --> 07:26.985
Mother always did that.

92
07:30.705 --> 07:33.065
This feels awkward. Move away.

93
07:40.905 --> 07:42.985
My Lord, His Grace wants to see you.

94
07:46.985 --> 07:48.105
The physician is here.

95
07:48.185 --> 07:49.665
Give Her Ladyship cold medicine before she sleeps.

96
07:50.465 --> 07:51.625
Yes.

97
08:03.185 --> 08:04.025
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

98
08:04.105 --> 08:05.425
Luckily, My Lady took the medicine in time.

99
08:05.505 --> 08:06.385
Your fever's gone.

100
08:07.665 --> 08:08.785
Where's His Lordship?

101
08:12.105 --> 08:13.145
Tell me the truth.

102
08:13.225 --> 08:15.745
My Lady, His Lordship went to His Grace's quarters last night.

103
08:15.825 --> 08:17.545
He never came back.

104
08:17.625 --> 08:21.345
The servants said the Duke punished him.

105
08:29.025 --> 08:30.105
Do you realise you were wrong?

106
08:32.904 --> 08:34.425
WANXIANG HALL

107
08:34.505 --> 08:35.385
Give it to me.

108
08:44.785 --> 08:45.905
What did I teach you?

109
08:46.705 --> 08:50.185
Your father and uncles died fighting for our country!

110
08:50.265 --> 08:53.385
You're the Lu family's only hope to carry on our legacy!

111
08:53.985 --> 08:56.185
-Do you remember that? -I haven't forgotten!

112
08:58.665 --> 09:01.705
Your Grace. He's knelt all night and taken forty lashes.

113
09:01.785 --> 09:03.185
He can't take any more.

114
09:03.265 --> 09:04.705
Your Grace, please calm down. Don't hit him again.

115
09:04.785 --> 09:06.065
Please, Your Grace.

116
09:08.545 --> 09:11.145
Tell me. Yesterday, Qi Zhongkai

117
09:11.705 --> 09:14.105
led several censors to block His Majesty's carriage.

118
09:14.825 --> 09:15.945
Was that your idea?

119
09:16.545 --> 09:18.145
His Majesty moved ahead the Grand Review.

120
09:18.665 --> 09:19.985
That already violated protocols!

121
09:20.065 --> 09:21.345
You still dare lie to me?

122
09:21.945 --> 09:23.945
You left your duties behind. Where did you go?

123
09:24.705 --> 09:25.625
Lu Zhuo.

124
09:26.505 --> 09:28.545
You're my most trusted eldest grandson.

125
09:29.145 --> 09:31.265
From a young age, you were upright and steady,

126
09:31.345 --> 09:32.425
careful in speech and firm in action.

127
09:33.025 --> 09:34.745
At thirteen, you followed me into the army.

128
09:34.825 --> 09:37.825
led a thousand horsemen into twenty thousand enemy troops,

129
09:37.905 --> 09:39.625
and still brought back their commander's head.

130
09:40.225 --> 09:42.065
You were a hero without equal.

131
09:42.705 --> 09:47.345
I may have lost three sons, but I still had you.

132
09:48.225 --> 09:50.985
You were my greatest pride, the Lu family's only hope.

133
09:51.585 --> 09:53.465
How could you? How dare you?

134
09:54.545 --> 10:00.585
If you still call me Grandfather, then tell me the truth.

135
10:01.425 --> 10:03.865
When you went after the bandits on South Mountain,

136
10:03.945 --> 10:05.225
who did you really do it for?

137
10:07.025 --> 10:08.865
I fought them to keep the people safe.

138
10:09.705 --> 10:10.785
There's no need to ask more, Grandfather.

139
10:10.865 --> 10:13.905
You won't tell me? Then I'll beat the truth out of you!

140
10:13.985 --> 10:16.705
-Stop! He can't take any more! -Stop!

141
10:16.785 --> 10:18.425
-Move! -Stop!

142
10:18.505 --> 10:19.665
-Please stop! -Get out of my way!

143
10:19.745 --> 10:20.745
I'll beat him to death!

144
10:20.825 --> 10:21.945
If my son did wrong,

145
10:22.025 --> 10:24.145
it's because I, as his mother, failed to educate him.

146
10:24.225 --> 10:26.305
Your Grace, punish me instead!

147
10:26.385 --> 10:27.265
Mother.

148
10:27.865 --> 10:29.865
-Move aside. -No. No…

149
10:31.465 --> 10:33.265
Someone, pull Mother away!

150
10:35.065 --> 10:36.225
-No! No! -Madam. Forgive us.

151
10:36.305 --> 10:37.785
-No! -Forgive us, Madam.

152
10:37.865 --> 10:38.985
Let go of me!

153
10:39.865 --> 10:40.945
Enough!

154
10:41.505 --> 10:45.865
Mother, how am I supposed to live?

155
10:45.945 --> 10:47.425
-Please calm down, Your Grace! -Don't hit him anymore.

156
10:47.505 --> 10:49.225
This is all my fault.

157
10:49.305 --> 10:50.625
Please don't blame His Lordship.

158
10:51.985 --> 10:52.945
What are you doing here?

159
10:53.945 --> 10:55.145
Go back.

160
11:02.065 --> 11:04.905
Traveling merchants are often harassed by South Mountain bandits.

161
11:05.865 --> 11:07.185
The northern army has repeatedly failed to stop them.

162
11:07.265 --> 11:08.825
His Lordship was upset when he heard.

163
11:09.425 --> 11:10.905
I was angry at the injustice,

164
11:10.985 --> 11:14.505
so I told him the men who abducted me as a child

165
11:14.585 --> 11:16.465
were also bandits from South Mountain.

166
11:16.545 --> 11:18.945
That's why His Lordship led troops against them.

167
11:19.025 --> 11:20.785
It's all my fault.

168
11:21.305 --> 11:23.185
I never should've told him.

169
11:25.545 --> 11:26.945
Please punish me as you see fit, Your Grace!

170
11:27.025 --> 11:28.025
You…

171
11:32.505 --> 11:34.585
Enough, enough.

172
11:35.185 --> 11:40.025
Even His Majesty took the censors' advice and returned to the palace.

173
11:40.625 --> 11:42.705
He didn't even punish the Lu family.

174
11:42.785 --> 11:45.065
So why are you so furious?

175
11:45.145 --> 11:47.705
Those South Mountain bandits have plagued the area for years,

176
11:47.785 --> 11:49.825
harming countless people.

177
11:49.905 --> 11:51.625
Lu Zhuo wiped them out.

178
11:51.705 --> 11:54.265
That's good for the country and the people.

179
11:54.865 --> 11:58.385
No matter how grave his mistake, a whole night on his knees is enough.

180
11:58.985 --> 12:01.185
Rao, help Lu Zhuo back.

181
12:05.625 --> 12:06.905
Hurry.

182
12:17.265 --> 12:19.265
-My Lord. My Lord! -Zhuo!

183
12:19.345 --> 12:22.105
-My Lord! -Zhuo!

184
12:34.625 --> 12:35.625
Enough.

185
12:35.705 --> 12:39.345
Your son is only injured. He's not dying.

186
12:39.425 --> 12:40.785
Stop crying!

187
12:40.865 --> 12:42.105
You're giving me a headache.

188
12:49.265 --> 12:50.745
You heartless old fool.

189
12:50.825 --> 12:54.185
If anything happens to Lu Zhuo, I'll never forgive you!

190
12:58.145 --> 13:00.265
I regret choosing the wrong woman for him.

191
13:00.345 --> 13:01.505
What do you mean?

192
13:02.105 --> 13:03.905
I knew at once who he was covering for.

193
13:04.665 --> 13:06.705
What he needs is a wife who can run his household

194
13:06.785 --> 13:07.785
and manage the family estate,

195
13:07.865 --> 13:10.385
a proper principal wife from a respectable family,

196
13:10.465 --> 13:13.665
not some celebrated Noble Lady or a beautiful, seductive wife.

197
13:13.745 --> 13:14.825
Even worse, she is someone

198
13:14.905 --> 13:17.425
inciting the husband to neglect his work and chase around her.

199
13:18.025 --> 13:19.185
I regret it now.

200
13:19.265 --> 13:21.745
I never should've arranged his marriage with a Wei daughter.

201
13:23.505 --> 13:24.345
My Lady.

202
13:25.025 --> 13:26.745
Let me take the medicine in.

203
13:30.865 --> 13:33.585
Rao caught a chill yesterday.

204
13:34.305 --> 13:36.065
Zhuo has plenty of people tending to him.

205
13:36.145 --> 13:38.305
You should go back and rest.

206
13:38.905 --> 13:40.105
Thank you, Mother.

207
13:44.305 --> 13:46.345
I don't want His Lordship catching my illness either.

208
13:48.425 --> 13:49.545
Thank you, Governess Miao.

209
13:50.385 --> 13:52.785
It's my duty. You needn't ask, My Lady.

210
14:02.825 --> 14:04.145
You're never satisfied.

211
14:04.945 --> 14:07.105
Have you forgotten when Lu Zhuo was dying,

212
14:07.705 --> 14:10.545
who kept her word and married him to save his life?

213
14:10.625 --> 14:12.025
He'd finally recovered,

214
14:12.105 --> 14:14.145
and now you've beaten him half to death.

215
14:14.745 --> 14:17.065
And you still fault his wife for being too beautiful?

216
14:17.145 --> 14:19.545
Have you forgotten how she risked her life to defend our family

217
14:19.625 --> 14:20.665
at the ancestral temple?

218
14:20.745 --> 14:22.785
You stubborn old fool!

219
14:23.545 --> 14:24.705
You…

220
14:27.225 --> 14:28.105
Women's logic.

221
14:33.025 --> 14:33.945
Thank goodness.

222
14:34.785 --> 14:36.945
You're awake! Thank goodness.

223
14:43.505 --> 14:46.665
Your wife is sick too.

224
14:47.385 --> 14:49.145
So I sent her back to rest.

225
14:49.225 --> 14:51.865
If you want to see her, I'll send for her.

226
14:51.945 --> 14:53.145
No need.

227
14:54.065 --> 14:55.825
There's still much to do at the barracks.

228
14:55.905 --> 14:57.745
Lie down. Come on, lie down.

229
14:57.825 --> 15:00.665
You nearly died last time.

230
15:00.745 --> 15:04.625
You've barely recovered, and now you've been whipped.

231
15:05.265 --> 15:09.385
The physician warned us again and again that you mustn't overexert yourself.

232
15:10.065 --> 15:12.145
You absolutely cannot get up.

233
15:12.825 --> 15:14.985
Do you hear me? Stay in bed.

234
15:15.625 --> 15:17.025
-Don't get up. -Exactly.

235
15:21.145 --> 15:21.985
Hopeless.

236
15:26.585 --> 15:27.945
Ignore that stubborn old man.

237
15:39.465 --> 15:41.625
What he needs is a wife who can run his household

238
15:41.705 --> 15:42.865
and manage the family estate,

239
15:42.945 --> 15:45.225
a proper principal wife from a respectable family,

240
15:45.305 --> 15:48.785
not some celebrated Noble Lady or a beautiful, seductive wife.

241
15:51.745 --> 15:53.065
Greetings, Noble Lady Wu'an.

242
15:55.545 --> 15:57.505
Was Zhuo punished because of you?

243
15:57.585 --> 16:03.145
SHIZHAI

244
16:03.225 --> 16:04.465
Uncle died young.

245
16:04.985 --> 16:07.985
So the burden of the Duke's Residence fell on Zhuo at an early age.

246
16:08.825 --> 16:11.105
And he's always been serious and reserved.

247
16:11.865 --> 16:13.865
He trains before dawn and studies at dawn.

248
16:14.745 --> 16:18.625
He works tirelessly every single day, yet never once complains.

249
16:19.425 --> 16:23.305
As his wife, it's your duty to stay by his side.

250
16:23.385 --> 16:25.305
How can you spend every day at your estate?

251
16:25.385 --> 16:27.785
Do you know what people are saying?

252
16:29.345 --> 16:30.665
Saying what?

253
16:30.745 --> 16:33.545
Your estate is full of male scholars.

254
16:33.625 --> 16:39.025
Some people say you're an unfaithful wife who's picking out lovers for yourself.

255
16:39.625 --> 16:43.505
Every prominent family in the capital knows about the Wei family's past.

256
16:46.385 --> 16:48.625
But you didn't watch your behavior.

257
16:49.545 --> 16:51.905
You even encouraged Zhuo to act recklessly.

258
16:51.985 --> 16:55.545
Do you know this is the first time His Grace has ever reprimanded him?

259
17:05.785 --> 17:06.625
What?

260
17:07.905 --> 17:09.665
Afraid I'll use my authority as Noble Lady Wu'an

261
17:10.345 --> 17:11.825
to have you seized and severely punished?

262
17:13.985 --> 17:15.585
I've always had a bad temper.

263
17:16.265 --> 17:18.065
And from now on, it'll only get worse.

264
17:18.985 --> 17:21.184
You can't afford to cross me. So stay out of my way.

265
17:22.345 --> 17:25.105
Go. Take good care of Lu Zhuo.

266
17:25.184 --> 17:27.065
I won't stop you from fawning over him.

267
17:28.265 --> 17:32.145
He earned that glory on the battlefield with his own blood!

268
17:32.945 --> 17:34.465
And you'll be the one to ruin it.

269
17:35.745 --> 17:36.745
Wei Rao,

270
17:37.825 --> 17:39.785
please leave my cousin alone.

271
17:46.105 --> 17:53.065
SHIZHAI

272
17:53.145 --> 17:58.785
ZUNSHAN SHRINE

273
18:08.465 --> 18:12.745
Your Ladyship, Noble Lady Wu'an sent back both the physician and the medicine.

274
18:15.025 --> 18:16.745
She's my daughter, all right.

275
18:16.825 --> 18:19.305
Once she digs in her heels, no one can change her mind.

276
18:19.385 --> 18:23.465
Your Ladyship, the palace has sent messengers three times.

277
18:23.545 --> 18:25.625
His Majesty keeps urging you to return.

278
18:25.705 --> 18:26.585
What's the rush?

279
18:26.665 --> 18:29.105
There's still one important matter I haven't dealt with.

280
18:29.185 --> 18:30.985
I'll explain it to him when I return.

281
18:32.545 --> 18:34.825
MAY THE FRAGRANCE ENDURE FOREVER

282
18:43.225 --> 18:45.105
After all the sins you've committed,

283
18:45.185 --> 18:47.265
no matter how devoutly you pray,

284
18:47.345 --> 18:49.545
why would heaven ever protect you?

285
18:50.865 --> 18:51.705
What?

286
18:51.785 --> 18:54.465
Here to mock me now that I've lost?

287
18:58.985 --> 19:02.665
Zhou Fu, do you really think you've beaten me?

288
19:03.865 --> 19:06.225
The first time I saw her,

289
19:06.305 --> 19:09.945
I knew she was that child.

290
19:12.625 --> 19:17.705
Then I had a wonderful idea.

291
19:17.785 --> 19:20.985
I'd make the two of them mortal enemies.

292
19:21.065 --> 19:25.185
I wanted to see which one you'd kill.

293
19:26.225 --> 19:29.025
You and Wei Jin were once engaged,

294
19:30.105 --> 19:32.225
but you'd barely even met.

295
19:32.305 --> 19:36.505
So why do you hate me this much?

296
19:39.825 --> 19:43.225
Back then, I came from a powerful family.

297
19:43.305 --> 19:47.985
In the capital, I was known for both beauty and talent.

298
19:48.065 --> 19:50.345
My parents searched far and wide

299
19:50.865 --> 19:57.425
and chose the most handsome and talented young man in the capital.

300
19:58.225 --> 20:00.025
I was overjoyed.

301
20:04.185 --> 20:05.825
Wei Jin insisted on ending our engagement.

302
20:06.425 --> 20:08.905
He made me the laughingstock of the capital.

303
20:08.985 --> 20:10.265
I was proud and headstrong.

304
20:10.865 --> 20:12.025
I tried to hang myself.

305
20:12.665 --> 20:15.385
To appease me,

306
20:15.465 --> 20:18.465
the Wei family offered me as the Earl's principal wife.

307
20:19.585 --> 20:21.105
I agreed at once.

308
20:21.785 --> 20:24.865
All I wanted then was to marry into the Wei family.

309
20:24.945 --> 20:29.865
I wanted Wei Jin to see what kind of woman he'd missed out on.

310
20:30.465 --> 20:33.585
I wanted him to regret it for the rest of his life.

311
20:34.665 --> 20:37.185
So you've resented me all this time.

312
20:38.105 --> 20:40.385
I thought you were the only one in the Wei family

313
20:40.985 --> 20:44.665
who was decent and kindhearted.

314
20:44.745 --> 20:47.425
You were always so good to me.

315
20:47.505 --> 20:48.665
Back then,

316
20:48.745 --> 20:52.345
you were both in newlywed bliss.

317
20:52.425 --> 20:58.345
How could you ever notice someone else suffering in silence?

318
20:59.105 --> 21:01.625
I regretted the moment when I married into the Wei family.

319
21:01.705 --> 21:04.745
Wei Jin was clearly handsome,

320
21:05.265 --> 21:06.665
and gifted in both scholarship and combat.

321
21:06.745 --> 21:11.825
Yet his older brother was a useless, lecherous fool.

322
21:12.545 --> 21:15.785
I'd been married less than three months,

323
21:15.865 --> 21:18.105
and not one of my maids

324
21:19.145 --> 21:22.585
escaped his advances.

325
21:23.265 --> 21:25.745
Disgusting. Shameless.

326
21:25.825 --> 21:28.985
A parasite obsessed with rank and status.

327
21:30.585 --> 21:34.585
Every time I saw him, I wanted to throw up!

328
21:38.745 --> 21:43.625
So you hated me even more.

329
21:43.705 --> 21:46.225
When you were pregnant,

330
21:46.305 --> 21:51.105
I once went to Wei Jin's study to bring him ginseng soup.

331
21:54.505 --> 21:56.345
Do you know what happened?

332
22:01.065 --> 22:05.185
A loving marriage? Faithful to each other?

333
22:06.545 --> 22:07.905
It's all a lie.

334
22:07.985 --> 22:10.225
All men are the same.

335
22:10.745 --> 22:13.785
Even the honorable Wei Jin was no exception.

336
22:23.865 --> 22:28.025
He threw you out, didn't he?

337
22:35.145 --> 22:39.185
I thought he'd expose me,

338
22:39.265 --> 22:44.185
call me shameless for seducing my husband's own brother,

339
22:44.265 --> 22:45.905
and ruin my reputation.

340
22:46.865 --> 22:49.505
But he… He simply walked out

341
22:51.025 --> 22:54.385
and quietly called my maid in.

342
22:55.625 --> 22:59.025
Afterward, he never told anyone.

343
22:59.905 --> 23:03.305
Instead, he went to my family's home himself

344
23:03.385 --> 23:09.665
and brought my mother back to talk some sense into me.

345
23:10.465 --> 23:12.225
You're insane.

346
23:13.785 --> 23:15.825
How could you do something like that?

347
23:15.905 --> 23:18.225
What if someone had found out?

348
23:18.305 --> 23:20.025
Did you ever think what would happen to you?

349
23:20.105 --> 23:22.025
You were the ones who ruined my life!

350
23:22.105 --> 23:23.545
Why should I let you live happily?

351
23:23.625 --> 23:25.665
I meant to take everyone down with me!

352
23:25.745 --> 23:30.305
But Wei Jin was too foolish, too honorable!

353
23:30.385 --> 23:33.465
He went to his older brother and gave him a stern talking-to.

354
23:33.545 --> 23:36.545
He warned him again and again to treat his wife well.

355
23:38.025 --> 23:40.705
It never even occurred to him

356
23:40.785 --> 23:46.425
that I had deliberately tried to ruin him.

357
23:48.345 --> 23:50.065
He was such a good man.

358
23:51.545 --> 23:55.105
Even someone as vicious as me

359
23:55.185 --> 23:58.425
couldn't bear to hurt him.

360
24:00.705 --> 24:03.785
But you… You!

361
24:04.865 --> 24:06.865
He died alone on the battlefield,

362
24:06.945 --> 24:09.745
in agony and despair.

363
24:10.385 --> 24:14.385
And you turned around and abandoned him,

364
24:14.465 --> 24:17.865
abandoned his daughter, and sought favor with the Emperor!

365
24:17.945 --> 24:21.785
If heaven won't punish a vicious woman like you,

366
24:21.865 --> 24:24.105
then I'll do it myself!

367
24:24.705 --> 24:26.025
I own what I've done.

368
24:26.985 --> 24:28.185
I won't deny it.

369
24:29.105 --> 24:32.305
If you hate me, come after me.

370
24:32.385 --> 24:35.385
Why did you hurt my child?

371
24:36.905 --> 24:39.625
You keep saying you never forgot Wei Jin.

372
24:40.145 --> 24:41.585
If he knew what you'd done,

373
24:41.665 --> 24:43.985
would he be thanking you for hurting his only child?

374
24:45.665 --> 24:47.225
He'd only hate himself

375
24:47.905 --> 24:51.985
for ever showing kindness to an ingrate like you.

376
24:52.505 --> 24:55.265
He'd want to kill you himself!

377
24:57.065 --> 24:58.145
Wei Jin…

378
25:04.185 --> 25:05.865
After all these years,

379
25:07.745 --> 25:13.345
do you really think I never once suspected Madam Chang?

380
25:13.945 --> 25:15.825
I chose not to investigate.

381
25:16.945 --> 25:21.025
That was the greatest mercy I could show you.

382
25:21.625 --> 25:24.905
Oh, please. You call that mercy?

383
25:25.505 --> 25:27.865
I saw through you long ago.

384
25:27.945 --> 25:30.545
You only dared bully a child.

385
25:30.625 --> 25:32.305
You never dared confront me.

386
25:33.185 --> 25:34.865
Because deep down,

387
25:35.385 --> 25:40.625
you're guilty, a coward, and utterly useless.

388
25:42.385 --> 25:47.265
Have you forgotten you have two daughters too?

389
25:48.345 --> 25:52.145
Before you did this, didn't you think of them at all?

390
25:54.105 --> 25:56.265
If the truth ever came out,

391
25:56.345 --> 26:00.185
what do you think I'd do to your daughters?

392
26:00.265 --> 26:03.065
M-My Shu is Prince Duan's wife.

393
26:03.745 --> 26:08.705
The married one is harder to get to for now.

394
26:10.185 --> 26:11.625
But you still have Wei Chan.

395
26:12.705 --> 26:16.905
A young, lively girl is bound to go out for spring outings.

396
26:17.785 --> 26:22.785
Maybe one day, she'll end up just like my Rao

397
26:22.865 --> 26:27.545
and vanish without a trace in the capital.

398
26:44.585 --> 26:48.305
If you hurt either of them, you'll kill Old Madam Wei!

399
26:49.145 --> 26:50.905
I don't want to go too far.

400
26:51.545 --> 26:53.465
I'll punish only the one truly responsible.

401
26:54.265 --> 26:57.905
Lady Guo, I never want to see you again.

402
26:59.945 --> 27:03.505
Zhou Fu, you have His Majesty behind you,

403
27:03.585 --> 27:05.985
and the whole world is on your side.

404
27:07.025 --> 27:11.065
But I still made a fool of you for sixteen years.

405
27:11.145 --> 27:13.985
Sixteen years apart from your daughter

406
27:14.065 --> 27:18.825
has filled her heart with resentment she'll never let go of.

407
27:18.905 --> 27:22.825
That sixteen-year rift between you can never be repaired!

408
27:22.905 --> 27:25.665
You think I've lost?

409
27:26.465 --> 27:28.785
You haven't won either.

410
27:28.865 --> 27:31.625
You've lost your daughter forever!

411
27:31.705 --> 27:34.025
That's victory enough for me!

412
27:37.585 --> 27:39.745
I may have wronged everyone,

413
27:39.825 --> 27:43.145
but I stayed true to the love I once had!

414
27:43.225 --> 27:46.225
Even after I die, I'll tell him

415
27:46.905 --> 27:50.065
that he was wrong about you

416
27:51.025 --> 27:55.625
and wrong about me…

417
27:59.745 --> 28:02.585
You were wrong about me.

418
28:03.105 --> 28:07.065
A wet nurse's daughter, a widow, could still become an imperial consort.

419
28:08.305 --> 28:11.865
Guo Yufeng, I don't believe what's broken can't be mended.

420
28:12.505 --> 28:16.865
I, Zhou Fu, as long as I'm still breathing,

421
28:17.385 --> 28:21.425
will win my daughter back and turn everything around.

422
28:22.625 --> 28:26.665
But you, you're already dead.

423
28:28.265 --> 28:29.945
No more chance for you.

424
29:09.705 --> 29:14.505
Grandmother, what did Mother do wrong to be sent away to a convent?

425
29:15.105 --> 29:17.225
She's managed the Earl's Residence all these years,

426
29:17.305 --> 29:18.905
and everyone there respects her.

427
29:18.985 --> 29:20.865
Didn't you always praise her

428
29:20.945 --> 29:23.265
as the most devoted daughter-in-law in the capital?

429
29:23.345 --> 29:25.985
Why would you suddenly send her to a convent for no reason?

430
29:26.065 --> 29:27.225
Please let Mother out.

431
29:27.825 --> 29:30.465
At the very least, please let me go in and see her!

432
29:34.865 --> 29:37.705
Father. Please, think of all Mother has done for this family.

433
29:37.785 --> 29:38.985
Put in a good word for her with Grandmother.

434
29:39.585 --> 29:40.705
-Father… -Get out of my way!

435
29:41.745 --> 29:42.905
Your mother spoiled you rotten.

436
29:42.985 --> 29:45.265
His Majesty spared me for failing to control my household

437
29:45.345 --> 29:47.745
and letting my wife commit such crimes. That's mercy enough.

438
29:47.825 --> 29:48.905
And you want me to plead for her?

439
29:49.505 --> 29:51.705
Do you want your father stripped of his office and title?

440
29:52.905 --> 29:54.585
What a disgrace to this family.

441
29:55.185 --> 29:57.425
How did I marry such a shameless woman?

442
29:59.065 --> 30:02.025
Grandmother, please.

443
30:02.705 --> 30:05.185
Your mother made a grave mistake.

444
30:06.065 --> 30:07.385
She had to be punished.

445
30:08.465 --> 30:10.545
I wish I could help you too.

446
30:10.625 --> 30:12.385
Dowager Lady, terrible news!

447
30:13.545 --> 30:15.825
Dowager Lady, Lady Guo…

448
30:16.425 --> 30:18.145
She hanged herself at the convent!

449
30:20.465 --> 30:22.425
-Dowager Lady! -Good riddance!

450
30:22.505 --> 30:23.665
-Death wipes away all sins. -Dowager Lady!

451
30:24.265 --> 30:25.585
At least she had some shame left!

452
30:27.745 --> 30:28.705
LOTUS ROOM

453
30:28.785 --> 30:31.865
I'm going to Mother… I'm going to Mother!

454
30:32.545 --> 30:33.585
Chan!

455
30:35.025 --> 30:37.145
You… you…

456
30:37.665 --> 30:39.625
You heartless man!

457
30:41.025 --> 30:44.825
No matter what she did, she was still your wife.

458
30:45.425 --> 30:47.825
You're beyond disgraceful!

459
30:48.505 --> 30:52.065
Shameless! Utterly shameless!

460
30:52.145 --> 30:54.265
Our earldom has endured for a century.

461
30:54.345 --> 30:57.425
How could I let a woman's crimes destroy our family's reputation?

462
30:57.505 --> 30:58.985
Now that she's dead,

463
30:59.625 --> 31:03.345
Lady Li won't blame the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence anymore.

464
31:03.865 --> 31:05.985
I did this for our family's future.

465
31:08.905 --> 31:13.865
Mother. We'll tell everyone that she died of a sudden illness.

466
31:14.465 --> 31:16.425
Even when we notify Prince Duan's Residence,

467
31:16.505 --> 31:18.265
we must keep the truth hidden.

468
31:21.065 --> 31:27.945
But Wei Shu is naturally a very perceptive child.

469
31:29.585 --> 31:32.305
Her… Her mother died so suddenly.

470
31:33.425 --> 31:36.545
How could we possibly hide it from her?

471
31:38.985 --> 31:41.185
Why are you still sitting here?

472
31:41.265 --> 31:44.825
Hurry and bring Chan back!

473
31:44.905 --> 31:46.825
-Bring her back! -I'll go right now!

474
31:46.905 --> 31:48.185
You…

475
31:50.305 --> 31:51.625
Don't worry, Dowager Lady.

476
31:53.185 --> 31:53.865
GRACE AND VIRTUE

477
31:53.945 --> 31:55.225
-Move! -Who are you?

478
31:55.305 --> 31:56.665
-Lady Chan, help! -How dare you seize people here?

479
31:56.745 --> 31:59.465
-Move! Hurry! -Lady Chan, help!

480
31:59.545 --> 32:02.145
Governess Zheng, what's going on?

481
32:02.225 --> 32:05.145
-Wei Rao got Madam killed! -Move! Hurry!

482
32:05.225 --> 32:06.825
Lady Li is the one who got your mother killed!

483
32:06.905 --> 32:08.905
-Never forget that! -What are you doing here?

484
32:08.985 --> 32:10.545
-Tell me! What are you doing? -Father!

485
32:10.625 --> 32:12.025
Wei Rao got Mother killed!

486
32:12.105 --> 32:13.505
And Lady Li from the palace was involved too!

487
32:13.585 --> 32:14.665
Tell me! Is it true?

488
32:14.745 --> 32:17.665
I'll tell you! I… I'll tell you!

489
32:19.505 --> 32:21.705
-Guards! Drag Lady Chan to her room! -Hurry!

490
32:21.785 --> 32:22.945
-Without my order… -Move!

491
32:23.025 --> 32:23.865
she is not to leave!

492
32:24.465 --> 32:25.905
-This isn't over! -Hurry!

493
32:25.985 --> 32:26.945
I'll tell Shu!

494
32:27.025 --> 32:28.145
-Shu is Prince Duan's wife! -Shut your mouth!

495
32:28.225 --> 32:30.425
-She'll avenge Mother! -Take her away! Now!

496
32:30.505 --> 32:32.065
She'll never forgive you!

497
32:32.145 --> 32:34.225
I will tell Shu!

498
32:34.305 --> 32:35.145
GRACE AND VIRTUE

499
32:48.625 --> 32:52.305
My Lord, the physician said you shouldn't be getting out of bed.

500
32:53.425 --> 32:55.265
-I'll get your medicine. -No need.

501
32:56.625 --> 32:57.465
Where's Wei Rao?

502
32:59.065 --> 33:01.665
These injuries were partly for her sake.

503
33:03.625 --> 33:04.665
She hasn't even visited me.

504
33:07.225 --> 33:08.345
Her Ladyship is in the storeroom.

505
33:08.425 --> 33:10.145
-I'll get her right away. -Wait.

506
33:11.665 --> 33:12.785
I'm this badly hurt,

507
33:13.385 --> 33:15.345
and she's still counting inventory?

508
33:16.425 --> 33:19.625
If I have to beg her to come, she won't mean it anyway.

509
33:20.345 --> 33:21.385
Forget it.

510
33:24.985 --> 33:27.385
I told you not to go, and you actually listened?

511
33:28.705 --> 33:30.105
Yes, My Lord. I'll go now.

512
33:30.705 --> 33:31.625
Wait.

513
33:33.225 --> 33:34.585
What will you tell her?

514
33:34.665 --> 33:38.185
I'll say your wound has gotten worse and you've started talking nonsense.

515
33:39.265 --> 33:41.305
I'll ask Noble Lady Wu'an to come quickly.

516
33:45.745 --> 33:46.585
Why are you still here?

517
33:53.945 --> 33:55.345
Heartless woman.

518
34:09.985 --> 34:11.105
Finally here to see your husband?

519
34:14.425 --> 34:15.945
Zhuo, are you feeling better?

520
34:27.824 --> 34:30.065
I brought you some food.

521
34:30.784 --> 34:33.505
I hope your wounds heal soon.

522
34:34.105 --> 34:35.185
Take it away.

523
34:35.264 --> 34:37.145
I made all of this myself.

524
34:37.225 --> 34:38.465
Please, Zhuo, just try a bite.

525
34:38.545 --> 34:40.105
It'll help you recover too.

526
34:42.665 --> 34:45.105
My Lady, His Lordship's injuries have gotten worse.

527
34:45.185 --> 34:46.865
He's been barely conscious.

528
34:50.625 --> 34:52.465
When I first came to the Lu family at seven,

529
34:52.545 --> 34:54.784
you'd often check on me,

530
34:54.865 --> 34:57.745
ask how my studies were going, and whether I needed anything.

531
34:58.345 --> 35:00.705
But as we grew older, you became distant.

532
35:00.785 --> 35:02.705
I only came because I was worried about you,

533
35:02.785 --> 35:04.465
yet you keep driving me away.

534
35:04.545 --> 35:06.345
What did I do wrong?

535
35:06.865 --> 35:08.025
His Grace even had you whipped.

536
35:08.105 --> 35:11.145
I know perfectly well who you're trying to protect.

537
35:11.985 --> 35:14.185
She's bad luck.

538
35:14.265 --> 35:16.465
Her father died the moment she was born.

539
35:16.545 --> 35:19.545
Sooner or later, she'll get you killed too!

540
35:19.625 --> 35:20.985
Enough!

541
35:22.465 --> 35:23.705
How dare you speak ill of Wei Rao?

542
35:24.465 --> 35:25.905
My father died young too.

543
35:26.545 --> 35:29.425
Are you going to say I was born to bring death to my father?

544
35:30.665 --> 35:31.625
What utter nonsense.

545
35:32.945 --> 35:35.585
When you came to the Lu family, I treated you like my own sister.

546
35:36.185 --> 35:37.945
But I'm married now.

547
35:38.025 --> 35:40.185
If I'm sick, my wife will care for me.

548
35:41.225 --> 35:43.705
And if she can't, I have attendants and medicine servants.

549
35:44.665 --> 35:46.145
It's not for an unmarried lady like you to tend to me.

550
35:47.265 --> 35:50.105
Who let you in? Who taught you such manners?

551
35:51.265 --> 35:52.385
Governess Miao.

552
35:54.265 --> 35:55.345
Governess Miao!

553
35:55.865 --> 35:56.945
Coming!

554
35:58.185 --> 35:59.665
What can I do for you, My Lord?

555
36:00.265 --> 36:01.505
I'm usually away with the army.

556
36:02.305 --> 36:03.705
Didn't know the ladies were raised without discipline.

557
36:04.385 --> 36:06.505
One and the other alike.

558
36:06.585 --> 36:08.305
Ask Grandmother for permission.

559
36:09.065 --> 36:11.665
Tell her I'd like to borrow Governess Li and Governess Bai from her.

560
36:13.225 --> 36:16.145
Starting tomorrow, every young lady in this family

561
36:16.225 --> 36:17.745
will study etiquette at Wanqing Pavilion at the Shen hour.

562
36:18.825 --> 36:19.745
Train them like soldiers.

563
36:19.825 --> 36:22.505
No meals until they get it right. And cut off their allowances.

564
36:23.225 --> 36:24.505
Zhuo, my cousin.

565
36:24.585 --> 36:25.505
Especially the Book of Etiquette and Ceremonial.

566
36:25.585 --> 36:27.265
Copy each chapter 100 times.

567
36:28.625 --> 36:29.985
Then they'll learn some manners.

568
36:31.905 --> 36:32.985
Anything else to say?

569
36:33.065 --> 36:35.465
Good advice is never welcome. Kindness gets us nowhere.

570
36:36.505 --> 36:39.105
You keep taking her side. Then I have nothing more to say!

571
36:40.345 --> 36:41.985
When she drags you down someday,

572
36:42.065 --> 36:43.745
I hope you won't regret it!

573
36:49.905 --> 36:50.945
Where is she?

574
36:52.065 --> 36:53.025
My Lord, do you mean…

575
36:55.825 --> 36:56.985
I didn't ask about anyone.

576
36:58.185 --> 36:59.225
Suit herself.

577
37:00.385 --> 37:03.065
She brought medicine before, but His Lordship sent her away.

578
37:03.145 --> 37:05.025
Who knew she'd come back again today?

579
37:05.105 --> 37:07.145
I'll tell the gatekeepers not to let her in again.

580
37:07.225 --> 37:09.505
What His Lordship does has nothing to do with me.

581
37:10.025 --> 37:11.025
How could it not?

582
37:11.105 --> 37:13.465
Upsetting My Lady would be a grave offense.

583
37:13.545 --> 37:15.425
This is all your fault! How irritating.

584
37:15.505 --> 37:17.185
-Stop following us! -Well.

585
37:17.265 --> 37:20.385
Who has upset our Noble Lady Wu'an now?

586
37:20.465 --> 37:21.545
Fourth Aunt.

587
37:23.105 --> 37:23.945
Did you need me?

588
37:24.025 --> 37:26.185
Someone's been waiting outside for you a long time.

589
37:26.265 --> 37:28.785
I came to ask if you really won't see her.

590
37:35.745 --> 37:38.905
Rao. The Empress Dowager will return to the palace soon.

591
37:38.985 --> 37:41.105
It won't be easy for you two to meet again.

592
37:41.745 --> 37:44.585
Whatever's on your mind, why not ask her face-to-face?

593
37:45.305 --> 37:47.225
Don't bottle it up and make yourself miserable.

594
37:47.305 --> 37:48.705
I have nothing to say to her.

595
37:49.745 --> 37:50.785
Rao.

596
37:51.865 --> 37:54.505
Think it through. Don't rush your decision.

597
37:57.585 --> 37:59.625
I understand. Thank you.

598
38:00.345 --> 38:02.265
Then I'll quietly bring Her Ladyship in.

599
38:02.345 --> 38:03.945
You two can talk in Jiangyun Hall.

600
38:04.025 --> 38:05.145
That way, no one else will be disturbed.

601
38:07.185 --> 38:08.065
Let's go.

602
38:24.025 --> 38:30.265
JIANGYUN HALL

603
38:47.665 --> 38:48.545
Greetings, Your Ladyship.

604
38:59.425 --> 39:01.265
I heard you fell ill after you returned.

605
39:01.785 --> 39:05.105
It was only a chill. I'm fine now.

606
39:06.065 --> 39:07.465
Thank you for your concern, Your Ladyship.

607
39:10.825 --> 39:11.865
Rao.

608
39:13.425 --> 39:15.705
I won't let what happened to you go unanswered.

609
39:16.465 --> 39:19.785
Lady Guo and Lady Heng'e have both been severely punished.

610
39:19.865 --> 39:22.545
As for your adoptive mother who deliberately deceived you,

611
39:23.065 --> 39:24.425
and the maid Bitao.

612
39:24.505 --> 39:25.985
Please, Your Ladyship,

613
39:26.065 --> 39:27.865
hand them over to me.

614
39:29.505 --> 39:30.425
All right.

615
39:31.505 --> 39:33.385
I'll have them sent to your estate.

616
39:34.265 --> 39:35.905
You may decide what to do with them.

617
39:38.785 --> 39:39.625
Rao.

618
39:41.065 --> 39:42.545
I'm returning to the palace.

619
39:43.865 --> 39:45.425
Before I leave,

620
39:46.785 --> 39:49.505
is there anything else I can do for you?

621
39:55.385 --> 39:56.865
Your Ladyship,

622
39:59.225 --> 40:00.545
why did you marry my father back then?

623
40:03.305 --> 40:05.545
His Majesty wanted me as his consort.

624
40:06.225 --> 40:09.065
But people mocked me for my background.

625
40:09.145 --> 40:09.985
GALAXY OF VERSES

626
40:10.065 --> 40:11.905
They looked down on me and your maternal grandmother.

627
40:13.105 --> 40:15.865
I was young and proud then. I refused to be looked down on.

628
40:17.505 --> 40:19.105
You married him out of defiance?

629
40:21.585 --> 40:24.345
Rao, I don't want to lie to you.

630
40:25.625 --> 40:27.505
Your father was skilled in both scholarship and combat.

631
40:28.545 --> 40:30.465
He was famous throughout the capital for his looks.

632
40:31.825 --> 40:33.305
If I was going to choose a husband,

633
40:33.385 --> 40:35.945
he'd either be the most powerful man alive

634
40:36.025 --> 40:38.065
or the finest man in the world.

635
40:39.185 --> 40:42.505
I never cared what people said about me.

636
40:42.585 --> 40:44.265
But you're my daughter.

637
40:44.345 --> 40:46.785
I swear to heaven,

638
40:47.865 --> 40:50.105
every day your father was alive,

639
40:51.185 --> 40:54.985
I loved him with all my heart and was completely faithful to him.

640
41:02.705 --> 41:03.745
I understand.

641
41:09.905 --> 41:10.825
Rao,

642
41:11.945 --> 41:14.065
whatever you want,

643
41:15.625 --> 41:17.865
I will do everything I can to make it up to you.

644
41:25.665 --> 41:27.065
There is one thing I want.

645
41:28.785 --> 41:30.145
I ask that you grant it, Your Ladyship.

646
41:40.025 --> 41:41.465
BRIGHT AS THE STARS

647
41:45.745 --> 41:46.785
Snap out of it.

648
41:48.265 --> 41:49.905
Snap out of it!

649
41:55.225 --> 41:57.265
You disappeared for four whole days.

650
41:57.345 --> 41:58.345
Even an imperial decree couldn't bring you back.

651
41:58.945 --> 42:01.305
What other consort in this palace gets such freedom?

652
42:01.385 --> 42:02.865
Are you still angry with me?

653
42:06.665 --> 42:08.385
Look. Take a good look.

654
42:10.865 --> 42:12.225
Your eyes are swollen from crying.

655
42:12.905 --> 42:16.425
You already have spies around me, why bother asking?

656
42:18.745 --> 42:20.785
They're the ones who deserve to be punished.

657
42:21.305 --> 42:23.345
And you've already punished everyone who deserved it.

658
42:23.425 --> 42:26.385
They wronged you. I never did anything to you.

659
42:30.665 --> 42:32.665
I'm not angry with you.

660
42:32.745 --> 42:33.945
I'm angry with myself.

661
42:35.665 --> 42:38.425
I thought keeping Rao away from me

662
42:38.505 --> 42:42.705
would spare her from palace intrigue and let her grow up safe.

663
42:43.345 --> 42:45.505
I thought the Wei family would treat her well.

664
42:45.585 --> 42:49.745
But who would've thought that where I couldn't see,

665
42:49.825 --> 42:52.265
she'd suffer so much?

666
42:52.945 --> 42:57.065
I want to make the Wei family pay for every bit of her suffering.

667
42:58.465 --> 43:01.785
From now on, I don't care what anyone says.

668
43:02.425 --> 43:04.785
I'll keep Rao by my side and protect her.

669
43:04.865 --> 43:06.825
Let's see who dares lay a finger on her.

670
43:08.905 --> 43:09.945
Listen to yourself.

671
43:10.945 --> 43:12.665
You always blame everyone else.

672
43:13.545 --> 43:15.665
Are you yourself free of such bias?

673
43:15.745 --> 43:18.945
Enough. Rao is married now.

674
43:19.025 --> 43:20.745
Her husband will protect her.

675
43:24.865 --> 43:27.305
-Come here. -Come on, tell me.

676
43:28.225 --> 43:29.305
What do you want?

677
43:30.345 --> 43:31.625
Sit.

678
43:34.545 --> 43:35.665
What do you want?

679
43:41.625 --> 43:42.585
Write.

680
43:43.785 --> 43:45.425
-Write what? -A divorce agreement.

681
43:46.385 --> 43:47.385
Divorce?

682
43:48.745 --> 43:50.305
-Divorce? -Did I burn you?

683
43:51.425 --> 43:53.545
I'm asking why you want a divorce.

684
43:56.185 --> 43:57.585
Have you forgotten, My Lord?

685
43:58.625 --> 44:01.585
When we first married, we made an agreement.

686
44:03.345 --> 44:05.425
We'd be husband and wife in name only.

687
44:05.945 --> 44:08.665
A loving couple in public, but living apart in private.

688
44:08.745 --> 44:12.265
No beating servants or killing innocents.

689
44:12.905 --> 44:14.145
And you would fulfill your duties as principal wife.

690
44:15.145 --> 44:16.385
In front of others,

691
44:16.465 --> 44:18.065
I'd give you all the honor and respect you were due.

692
44:18.665 --> 44:23.265
After one year, we'd divorce and go our separate ways.

693
44:23.345 --> 44:26.505
We'd each be free to remarry, with no ties between us.

694
44:27.825 --> 44:29.185
If either of us broke our vow,

695
44:29.265 --> 44:30.945
we'd be struck by lightning and burned by fire,

696
44:31.025 --> 44:32.425
then suffer the blade.

697
44:37.465 --> 44:39.345
You swore it yourself, My Lord.

698
44:40.585 --> 44:43.625
That one day, if we broke our vow,

699
44:44.225 --> 44:45.665
we'd be struck by lightning and burned by fire,

700
44:47.065 --> 44:48.265
then suffer the blade.

701
44:49.505 --> 44:51.145
The year isn't up yet.

702
44:51.225 --> 44:52.385
Why are you so eager to divorce me?

703
44:59.065 --> 45:00.305
How could I forget?

704
45:01.745 --> 45:02.785
You have your eye on Qi Zhongkai.

705
45:05.585 --> 45:08.785
General Qi and I are only friends now.

706
45:09.745 --> 45:10.825
For now?

707
45:11.985 --> 45:12.825
What about the future?

708
45:14.065 --> 45:16.985
As for the future, who knows?

709
45:22.385 --> 45:23.905
Our marriage was decreed by the Empress Dowager.

710
45:24.745 --> 45:26.545
A sudden divorce could anger the Imperial Family.

711
45:28.465 --> 45:30.225
You said that yourself.

712
45:30.305 --> 45:31.745
Things are different now.

713
45:32.345 --> 45:37.065
Lady Li promised me she'd ask His Majesty to grant us permission.

714
45:39.185 --> 45:40.865
An imperial decree won't stop the gossip.

715
45:42.385 --> 45:43.905
Divorce won't hurt me.

716
45:43.985 --> 45:45.265
But it could ruin your reputation.

717
45:45.345 --> 45:47.625
People will surely speak ill of you and spread vicious rumors.

718
45:47.705 --> 45:49.265
and drag your name through the mud.

719
45:49.345 --> 45:50.425
-So… -Lu Zhuo.

720
46:03.265 --> 46:04.785
Can we just stay in this marriage?

721
46:26.505 --> 46:30.625
You're a true hero, and a true gentleman.

722
46:32.545 --> 46:35.465
You have the realm in your heart and the weight of it on your shoulders.

723
46:36.985 --> 46:40.105
You deserve a wife from a noble family,

724
46:41.265 --> 46:42.985
a gentle and virtuous woman,

725
46:43.865 --> 46:44.945
not someone like me,

726
46:46.265 --> 46:49.665
who defies every rule and does whatever she pleases.

727
46:53.745 --> 46:55.185
Who put these ideas in your head?

728
46:57.945 --> 46:59.185
You and I, are simply

729
47:01.945 --> 47:02.785
not right for each other.

730
47:22.985 --> 47:24.425
Perhaps I've failed you as a husband.

731
47:26.625 --> 47:28.945
That's why you cast me aside so easily.

732
47:34.065 --> 47:35.025
Wei Rao.

733
47:36.025 --> 47:37.705
I'm not a man you can just leave behind.

734
47:39.225 --> 47:40.825
Unless I agree,

735
47:42.785 --> 47:44.105
you won't leave the Lu family.

736
47:50.985 --> 47:52.545
The imperial decree will arrive any moment.

737
47:52.625 --> 47:53.465
Think whatever you want.

738
47:54.585 --> 47:55.425
You…

739
48:02.825 --> 48:03.985
Lu Zhuo.

740
48:06.985 --> 48:08.225
Lu Zhuo.

741
48:09.185 --> 48:10.465
Someone, come!

742
48:14.465 --> 48:16.025
Someone!

743
48:17.625 --> 48:20.545
-My Lord! -Lu Zhuo!

744
48:21.265 --> 48:22.305
-Lu Zhuo! -My Lord!

745
48:22.985 --> 48:24.585
-Lu Zhuo! -My Lord!

746
50:41.025 --> 50:44.025
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
